@startuml

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

component "Kafka Broker" as Kafka
component "Worker Node" as Worker
component "Retry Mechanism" as Retry
component "Dead Letter Queue" as DLQ
component "Monitoring System" as Monitor
component "Telemetry Service" as Telemetry

Kafka --> Worker

Worker --> Worker : retry loop\n(idempotent logic)

Worker --> Retry : transient failure
Retry --> Kafka : requeue message

Worker --> DLQ : fatal error

Worker --> Monitor : metrics (lag, errors)
Kafka --> Monitor : consumer lag

Worker --> Telemetry : partial results

Telemetry --> Monitor : system health view

@enduml